\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {37}{\ignorespaces Family tree, depth 5, $n=3$ per arm, one batch, 2 layers, 100 epochs; held-out accuracy, trained at $T=64$; hub floor 0.1628. \texttt  {Level15} = MapFormer-WM plus filter; \texttt  {MapWM-Flat} = MapFormer-WM; MapEM-NC-NL = non-commutative MapEM; \texttt  {Plain-Flat} = index transformer. Contrasts at $T=64$: delta (sd of paired differences, \textsc  {mde}\ = minimum detectable effect, $2.8\,\mathrm  {sd}/\sqrt  {n}$, seeds with a positive difference); unmeasured = within the \textsc  {mde}. Exploratory. Reading: non-commutativity is real but small; path integration's gain is larger.\relax }}{39}{table.caption.139}\protected@file@percent }
